<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>string of hearts</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">xela fella</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">string of hearts</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0LlJCxqTsrbF8yBH5HyXi4</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.870" end="00:29.540">Why am I the one who always makes sense</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.540" end="00:36.250">Yes I try to disappoint but I always end up on the fence</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.250" end="00:44.250">I wish I didn't waste all my time every night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.150" end="00:54.150">Why am I the one who always ends up so tired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.520" end="01:04.520">Why am I the one who always ends up so tired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.670" end="01:08.180">Listen to me babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.180" end="01:11.310">You're not a bright one coming at me with that tongue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.310" end="01:15.250">And you can't tell the way with that liquor on your brain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.250" end="01:16.750">And now I've left you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.500" end="01:18.670">In the streets and you can't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.670" end="01:26.670">Tell me from the other girl you came with</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.970" end="01:30.380">I was wondering what took you so long</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.380" end="01:33.080">Yes I tried to play the victim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.080" end="01:36.940">Until the victim came along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.940" end="01:44.940">Now she listens to the way I make out with the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.100" end="01:55.100">Why am I the one who always ends up so tired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.730" end="02:03.200">Why am I the one who always ends up so tired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.200" end="02:07.200" /></div></body></tt>